          </div>
          <div class="ds-spec__row ds-spec__row--wide">
            <span class="ds-spec__k">{t.specA11y}</span>
            <p class="ds-spec__v">
              {
                it
                  ? "È un <button> dentro uno shadow root, quindi arriva già con ruolo e nome accessibile propri: non serve — e non va — avvolgerlo in un altro link."
                  : "It is a <button> inside a shadow root, so it already carries its own role and accessible name: wrapping it in another link is unnecessary, and wrong."
              }
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ds-panel" data-ds-panel="ingresso-titolo" aria-labelledby="ingresso-titolo-t">
