              : "What a card opens: one large photo and the matching piece of the bio. It reuses the shell of the Fun fact / Belongings / Travel drawers, so it brings neither CSS nor script of its own — memory-drawer.ts finds it by itself, because for every [data-drawer-open] it looks up #dialog-<key>. Shown here with the open attribute so it stands still."
