              : "Two levels and no more: primary (one action per screen) and secondary. If everything is primary, nothing is. Since 2026-08-27 the secondary also carries the lens colour, on its hairline and its arrow — it used to be a grey ghost, identical across all three. The label stays ink: the accent as a BORDER needs 3:1 (1.4.11) and orange holds 3.62:1, but as TEXT it would need 4.5:1 and does not have it."
