              : "A demoted selector: not equally weighted buttons at the top of the page. Native <details>, options that are real links. Each item shows ITS OWN lens colour, not the current one: it is a preview of where you are going. Since 2026-08-27 it lives in the bar beside the language switch and takes its shape: a pill, the same height, a strong hairline — in the middle of the text it read as a settings control. It is still demoted, but by size rather than by hiding at the foot of the column."
