                  : "To switch lens from inside the CV. It sits in the bar, right of the guiding line and left of the language switch: they are the page's two reading controls."
              }
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="ds-spec__row ds-spec__row--dont">
            <span class="ds-spec__k">{t.specDont}</span>
            <p class="ds-spec__v">
              {
                it
