                  : "Do not promote it to equally weighted buttons at the top: someone arriving from a job ad should not read «I am also two other things» in the seven seconds they are deciding. Being in the bar is not a promotion — it is chrome, like the language switch. And the dropdown opens anchored right: growing rightwards it would run off a phone screen."
              }
