                  : "Do not drop the count when the section is filtered: without «5 of 24» filtering does not read as choosing, it reads as hiding. And do not put a bar back in place of the dot: it was the same shape as the tick that opens rows (.tick), and on «Off the clock» the two ended up on the same line — a decorative mark that looks like a control takes credit away from the control."
