              : "One of the three live Lit islands, and the only one present on nearly every page. The markup is a single line: position, z-index and behaviour live inside the component and in one rule in global.css. What follows is the real FAB, not a copy — look at the bottom right: that is where it sits, and where it must sit. It disappears when you leave this panel, because a hidden panel takes it with it."
